WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.504
A meaningful line graph needs a title, labelled axes, sensible equal intervals and

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:06.728
correctly plotted points.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:12.996
What graph component is described as: the label along the horizontal axis? The answer

00:00:12.996 --> 00:00:16.899
is x-axis label. This feature is called the x-axis label.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.722
A rainfall line graph for a school fundraiser is missing: the measure on the vertical

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:26.404
axis. Which feature should be added? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:27.283 --> 00:00:32.432
A rainfall line graph for a school fundraiser is missing: the measure on the vertical

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:37.238
axis. Which feature should be added? The answer is y-axis label. This feature is

00:00:37.238 --> 00:00:38.611
called the y-axis label.
